the final contact block of the Green matrix of a layered device. \
CentralBlockGreens[z, {diagonalBlocks, lowerBlocks}, sigmas, mode] returns \
the contact block or the final block column according to mode. \
CentralBlockGreens[z, {diagonalBlocks, lowerBlocks, upperBlocks}, sigmas, \
mode] uses explicitly supplied upper off-diagonal blocks.", "synonyms" -> {}, 
